#: global-menu@unmade.space/prefsPages/appearancePage.js:108
msgid ""
"Blurs what is behind popup menus, through Blur My Shell. The panel bar "
"itself is blurred by Blur My Shell's own \"Panel\" setting."
msgstr ""
"Desenfoca lo que hay detrás de los menús emergentes mediante Blur My Shell. "
"El desenfoque de la propia barra del panel se controla con la opción «Panel» "
"de Blur My Shell."

#: global-menu@unmade.space/prefsPages/appearancePage.js:109
msgid "Blur My Shell is not installed, so these options will have no effect."
msgstr ""
"Blur My Shell no está instalado, así que estas opciones no tendrán ningún "
"efecto."

#: global-menu@unmade.space/prefsPages/appearancePage.js:114
msgid "Blur behind popup menus"
msgstr "Desenfocar detrás de los menús emergentes"

#: global-menu@unmade.space/prefsPages/appearancePage.js:115
